WEBVTT

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.840
Dr. Hell! Dr. Hell!

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.930
Dr. Hell!

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:15.570
Oh! What are you doing, Dr. Hell?

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:20.350
Why do you direct that rifle towards me?

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:24.880
Could it be that I couldn't finish with Mazinger?

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.210
Dr. Hell, I promised you that I would finish with him!

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.670
Please, give me another chance!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.500
I assure you that I will finish with this damn Bazinger, do not shoot!

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.100
It's impossible

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:56.100
It's what happened to me

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.700
As you can see, you have become a

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:05.420
Baron Ashler, how do you feel being a giant?

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:16.340
Listen to me, Dr. Hell. How dare you treat me like a beast?

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.540
What a question!

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:23.580
Many were afraid of me too. I can not follow you indefinitely.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.020
And what do you intend to do for it?

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.800
To be surprised, he has only returned to his original appearance.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:51.390
Endo!

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:55.240
An Ashler, you were talking seriously a moment ago.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.640
In no way, but as my body grows...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.980
I want my words

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.510
Please, Dr. Hell, forgive me!

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:17.260
I will forgive you this time, but even if you try to attack me, I will not be frightened, only that the next time you try something will cost you your life.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:17.920
It will not happen.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.360
Look, this is a rifle that I have developed to produce giants.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.440
It's a wonderful soul!

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:29.810
But that wonderful weapon is not yet completely...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.520
It needs to be tested.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.500
And do you think I should test it?

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.730
That's right, Baron Ashler.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:43.270
Do anything giant to fight Mazinger.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:48.240
And you should know that this rifle can only be used once more.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:49.340
Don't forget that.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:56.670
Baron Ashler, go and destroy Mazinger.

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:05.270
What are you doing?

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:06.730
Give me a break!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.550
I feel like it's getting late.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:12.710
The girls pay attention to our personal appearance.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:15.950
Don't tell me...

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:17.740
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.330
By chance, do you know what day it is today?

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.300
I am the adversary of the foundation of your school.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:29.860
What are you doing?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.700
What a wonderful day, with so much fun and all the food that we will have there!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:40.510
It's true, Chiro, that you are a glutton of firsts.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:44.100
Well hurry up if you want to go with us.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.300
I also have to pay attention to my appearance.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.060
What?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:54.390
You do not understand, yes, but a little personal care before dinner raises the appearance.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.120
That's enough!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.190
Now! Wait!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:22.170
What do you think of that?

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.340
DesiadoDevil

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.850
He looks like a dog

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.390
What do these pigs look like?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.170
Do you think a pig can beat Mazinger?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.170
Is it that you are more than I always assumed?

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:49.280
There is enough time and there must be something strong enough to beat Mazinger.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:55.320
We celebrate our 50th anniversary.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.400
But why don't we go to where the food is?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.040
Why not? I'm hungry too, Chiro.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:09.840
No, Koji, we must see it all before dinner.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.640
A mechanical doll!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:21.460
How pretty!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.850
You did it, yes.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.940
It's very well done.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:28.990
What's your name?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.800
Me llamo Kunichi.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.060
And this is my brother, Vicon.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.120
Do you say this is your brother Vickon?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.590
Yes, I don't have true brothers.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.620
That's right, Kevicon is my brother.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.260
That doll is your brother!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:44.920
Don't make me laugh!

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:45.630
Why?

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:48.290
Vicon is an extremely intelligent brother.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.500
Your brother is a fool!

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.890
And he's very small, just like you.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.050
He's a very confused brother.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:11.560
I need to do a little exercise to digest everything I've eaten.

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.380
Enough of chiquillabas.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.120
Don't mess with me, cabuto. I never reject a fight.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.980
Chicón, show them your strength.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.780
You won't do it!

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.610
Bicón will fight you!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.400
Enough with the jokes!

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.430
Bicón, attack! Attack!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.600
Now you'll see!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:55.480
The game is over! If you continue like this, we'll miss the celebration!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.050
You're right, Sayaka! Your brother is very strong!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.310
Take good care of him, you know?

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.700
...Koyi and Kabuto seem to be celebrating something.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:27.640
Koyi is a kid who is still allowed to be taken for school celebrations,

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.700
while Dr. Hell...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.720
All mechanical monsters await the opportunity to conquer the world!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:39.250
It's a great mechanical doll!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.650
Yes, I would like to have one like that.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:55.930
You don't have the right hand.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.730
There is no special reason, I just couldn't finish.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.940
to do it in time for today.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:02.100
Really?

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.740
Tell me, Junichi, does Vicon understand everything you're telling him?

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:11.020
I'm not very sure, although he can hear everything I'm saying.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.440
Why do you think that?

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:14.520
I know it.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.090
Mechanical dolls understand people's minds.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:19.230
What?

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.420
Many times when I'm operating on Mazinger...

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:26.080
Their reactions are as I am thinking them.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.880
and I feel that too.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.560
and many times with Aphrodite.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.680
An old story says that when something is done with soul and heart,

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.340
this something is possessed by a spirit.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:42.450
Yes, and Junichi and Vicon, I think they must have that kind of relationship.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.050
Huh!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.150
And talk!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.530
He's dying of hunger, huh?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.550
Is this mechanical doll going to work?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.480
Sure, you'll see.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:36.650
Magnificent boy!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:38.370
I'm with...

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.390
My count of this name indicates a lot of strength.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.200
Would you like to sell me to Vicom?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.160
I can't.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.170
I would pay any amount.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:53.310
No, he's my brother and I can't get rid of him.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.090
That's very unfortunate!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.980
I'm not going to eat anymore.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.630
I'm going to eat.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:26.240
You would eat more if you ate slower.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.730
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:38.920
What happened?

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.810
They have robbed me! They have robbed me of my CON!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:43.620
and he stole it.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.200
A woman stole it.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:46.060
A woman!

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:47.040
What?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:49.560
I will go to look for it.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:22.990
The woman who robbed you of Vicon was wearing a black suit.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.780
Yes, that's right.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.580
Yes, it's him.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.100
Eh? Who is he?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.820
I'm sure you think...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.780
It must have been Baron Ashler.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:33.660
What?

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.960
Koji, what is going to happen to my beacon now?

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.320
But what will this Baron Ashler be planning?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.670
by stealing this mechanical doll.

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:59.050
Bicón, I will turn you into a war machine with the same extermination qualities.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.000
that the monsters of Dr. Hell have to deal with.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.280
Thanks for watching!

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.230
I already have a desire to see you fight!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:09.430
What a nice surprise!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.130
I'll take you there!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.900
That's how the Baron Ashler stole the doll.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:20.040
What will she think to do with him?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:25.040
Don't worry so much! What can she do with such a tiny robot?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:28.170
But the thing is, with the Baron Ashler...

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.000
You can never know what you are doing.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.400
That's what I'm planning.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.780
I have a bad feeling.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.980
Thank you.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.450
and destroy it with the great power that I have provided you.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.580
A boy has been built, he has grown and destroyed the city.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:07.660
Nothing standing unless something is done very soon.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:14.360
I do not know, I do not know what is happening here.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:18.490
Enough of deception, you were not the one who enlarged that robot.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.270
No, I did not do it.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:23.420
Anyway, you will come with us to the station.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:27.020
Please wait!

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.510
He has nothing to do with this.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.240
What do you say?

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:43.280
The only thing possible is to stop Vickon with Mazinger.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.930
Another beacon! Destroy! Kill!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.380
I'm going to destroy you!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:20.480
Enrico IX, you have many other weapons and the power needed to destroy Mazinger, show them what you are capable of!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.250
It's very dangerous to stay here.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.960
Mazinger will be destroyed, Sayaka!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:07.440
What?

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:32.640
Sayaka, can you communicate with Mazinger?

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.490
Yes, I can do it with this radio. Why?

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:42.020
Since Yavicon is not my brother, I can tell you that the only weak point he has are the two antennas in the head.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:42.440
What?

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:45.270
When the antennas are broken, everything else works badly.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.210
Thank you very much, Junichi. Koji, do you hear me?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.220
Yes, the antennas are his weak point.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.020
has been defeated

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.980
That was nothing more than a test. It doesn't matter if he was defeated or not.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:34.510
Inform Dr. Hercules that the giant producer rifle has been a success.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:49.660
Picard, you were not bad, but by obeying the enemy you did terrible things that turned you into a real monster of evil.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.800
Junichi, after all, a robot is not a human.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:57.850
A robot can be good or bad, it depends on who makes it work.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:04.350
One.
